* PSA4-5043+ DC bias behaviour only. It draws its typical current from the output
* pin once biased, and has no RF model. Use the cascade check for RF.
* Pins: 1 RF out and supply, 2 ground, 3 RF in, 4 ground.
.subckt PSA4_5043_BIAS out g1 in g2
Bid out g1 I = 0.058 * tanh(max(V(out,g1),0) / 1.0)
Rin in g1 1G
Rg g2 g1 1m
.ends
